{"id":"e6f1cb167547409f","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-derivative-ordinal.md","title":"Derivative of Ordinal","display":"df-derivative-ordinal — Derivative of Ordinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-derivative-ordinal","aliases":["72-df-derivative-ordinal"],"display":"df-derivative-ordinal — Derivative of Ordinal","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226","verification_status":"reviewed-definition","proof_status":"definition-well-defined","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-derivative-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-derivative-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-derivative-ordinal — Derivative of Ordinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Local derivation in ZFC; book background Ch.IV §1.1, print210–214; PDF222–226"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed-definition"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"definition-well-defined"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是 ZFC 中给定的可定义正规序数类函数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta)\">\\(\\alpha&lt;\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)&lt;f(\\beta)\\)</span> 且对每个非零极限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f(\\xi)\">\\(f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi&lt;\\lambda}f(\\xi)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>所有量词仅量化集合序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f&#39;\">\\(f&#39;\\)</span> 是下式逐集合阶段递归定义的可定义类函数，不是以真类为定义域的集合函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fix}_f(\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f(\\xi)=\\xi.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Fix}_f(\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f(\\xi)=\\xi.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f&#39;(\\alpha):=\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:f(\\xi)=\\xi\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ (f&#39;(\\beta)&lt;\\xi)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f&#39;(\\alpha):=\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:f(\\xi)=\\xi\\land\\forall\\beta&lt;\\alpha\\ (f&#39;(\\beta)&lt;\\xi)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第 IV 章 §1.1 的正规函数与不动点枚举背景。任意序数γ之上，迭代f从γ+1起取ω次上确界得到不动点（若提前稳定也成立），故不动点类无界；连续性给出闭性。每个递归阶段只有集合多个前值，其上界之上存在最小不动点，所以递归有唯一值。此定义枚举全部不动点；在极限阶段由闭性得到连续性。没有把类函数伪装成集合元素。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha<\\beta\\to f(\\alpha)<f(\\beta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"f(\\lambda)=\\sup_{\\xi<\\lambda}f(\\xi)","display":false},{"tex":"f'","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Fix}_f(\\xi)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ f(\\xi)=\\xi.","display":true},{"tex":"f'(\\alpha):=\\min\\{\\xi\\in\\operatorname{Ord}:f(\\xi)=\\xi\\land\\forall\\beta<\\alpha\\ (f'(\\beta)<\\xi)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1562,"backlinks":[{"id":"0834bea6989e10f4","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\varepsilon_\\eta$ 是正规函数 $\\beta\\mapsto\\omega^\\beta$ 的不动点按序枚举，取 [[72-df-derivative-ordinal]] 的导函数；$\\mathrm{BH}$ 为本节点定义的特定约定。"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-287","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-derivative-ordinal|df-derivative-ordinal — Derivative of Ordinal]]"}],"outgoing":[]}